<title>FRANCE: French TV programme raises $77 million for health.</title>
<headline>French TV programme raises $77 million for health.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>France's 10th annual telethon to raise funds to fight genetically linked diseases received record pledges of 388 million francs ($77 million) when it ended on Sunday after a non-stop 30-hour live programme, organisers said.</p>
<p>The figure was 11 million francs ($2 million) higher than last year.</p>
